    "- Each point: the error after that epoch's update.\n",
    "\n",
    "The initial MSE before training is not included in this curve.\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Expected Behavior\n",
    "\n",
    "The curve should decrease rapidly during the early epochs and then\n",
    "flatten as the parameters approach the least-squares solution.\n",
    "\n",
    "A nearly flat curve means that additional updates produce little\n",
    "change in training MSE at the displayed scale. It does not mean\n",
    "that the error is zero.\n",
    "\n",
    "In this experiment, the final MSE and coefficients also agree with\n",
    "the Normal Equation at the displayed precision. That comparison\n",
    "supports convergence; a flat curve alone would not prove it.\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Scope\n",
    "\n",
    "This curve shows optimization progress on training data.\n",
    "It does not measure performance on unseen observations or establish\n",
    "whether the model generalizes well."
