    "Both lines are drawn using coefficients converted to the original\n",
    "income scale. Therefore, the horizontal axis is directly comparable\n",
    "with the observed income values.\n",
    "\n",
    "If gradient descent has converged to the analytical solution,\n",
    "the lines should nearly overlap. The dashed style helps make both\n",
